# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# Every path that doesn't match a real file gets index.html, so React
# Router can handle /login, /chat/:slug, /verify/age, etc. without 404.
# The "200" code means Cloudflare rewrites (not redirects) — the URL
# in the browser stays the requested path, but the served file is
# index.html. React Router reads window.location on mount and renders
# the right page.
